<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>参加对象：高二全体师生</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>活动主题：“上青古道”毅行</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>活动时间：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>日（星期二）<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">（雨天改期，</B></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"> </B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>上周六的课）</SPAN></B></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>出发时间：</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=3> </FONT><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>7:00</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>在学校西门集合上车，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>7:40</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>到达锁泗桥。</SPAN></FONT></P>
