<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>5.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>毅行线路：“上青古道”为起点，平水中学为终点，约</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>10km</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>。其中</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>5km</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>为山路，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>公路为平坦路。</SPAN></FONT></P>
