<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>考勤：王芳芳</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>拍照：舒凤</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3> </FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>考评：林萍华</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>说明：各班随队老师由班主任安排具体任务</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>三、纪律要求及注意事项</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>1. </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>活动前，班主任要做好安全教育和调查工作，体质特殊和身体不佳的学生，不宜参加。参加和不参加的学生都要填写好“申请书”（“申请书”由班主任保存）。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>2. </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>出发前以及返回学校，班主任都要组织专人清点人数；班主任活动中要随带家长联系电话，保证紧急情况下的即时联系。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>3. </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>学生必须严守纪律，不得相互超越，不得追逐打闹，不得私自离队，不得带手机，严禁乱丢垃圾。要做到一切行动听指挥，严格遵守集合时间。自备矿泉水和午餐。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>4. </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>在步行过程中，注意安全，按时到达集合地点，整队乘车返校。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US>5. </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>整个活动的组织情况由德育处负责评价，评价结果作为大型活动组织奖的考核依据。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: right; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=right><FONT size=3><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">            </SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>德育处</SPAN></FONT></P>
